 style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13pt;\">바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 104pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -104pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -104pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:104.0pt;text-indent:-104.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;\">교육명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: Physical AI</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;\">의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">Vision-LLM(Gemma) </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;\">융합 멀티모달 시스템 교육</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;\">교육기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2026. 8. 24.(</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-